{"h":"<p>这是使用 CUDA 时 768*768 的最清晰设置。我希望你们也分享你们的发现。我自己无法进行广泛的测试。操那些大比特币挖掘者。我在显卡最贵的时候买了1660s</p><p>如果有人感兴趣，这就是我使用它的方式</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/WASasquatch/PPF_Noise_ComfyUI/wiki/Walkthrough\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/WASasquatch/PPF_Noise_ComfyUI/wiki/Walkthrough</a></p><p>我的英语不是很好，但是这个问题可以解释工作流程是如何运作的。</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/WASasquatch/was-node-suite-comfyui/issues/175\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/WASasquatch/was-node-suite-comfyui/issues/175</a></p><p>我相信这可以带来一些免费的质量改进，几乎不需要任何成本。好不好，你需要根据我生成的图像来判断。我需要 120 秒才能生成 1024 像素的大图像，因此我需要更多的人进行实验，找出哪种噪声最适合图像中的细节。这就是为什么我不断发布东西</p><p>感谢@WAS</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/user/WAS/models\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://civitai.com/user/WAS/models</a></p><p>“WASasquatch on GitHub”感谢他们的贡献</p><p>old⬇</p><p>我在大约一周的时间里大量使用了我的工作流程，发现了许多影响图像的设置。之前我懒得写详细的工作流程说明。随着静音开关的实现，我再次合并了两个核心，我将详细解释它是如何工作的</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/c7426da7-a0da-46b1-a1fe-c7292210a306/width=525/c7426da7-a0da-46b1-a1fe-c7292210a306.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/1ca10976-d45f-4765-be5f-a650dce9c0f2/width=525/1ca10976-d45f-4765-be5f-a650dce9c0f2.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>它需要很多节点，所以我建议下载核心并自己构建</p><p>国人需要注意manager最近更新后拉取本地的节点列表时会报字符错，报错的那一行里”r“改成\"rb\"即可</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/15445b46-6556-40d7-9556-81d4766bb6dd/width=525/15445b46-6556-40d7-9556-81d4766bb6dd.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/47aa14b5-cdc4-47c4-949e-211897e03740/width=525/47aa14b5-cdc4-47c4-949e-211897e03740.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/5df692b3-37db-44f8-98aa-46de96e6bed1/width=525/5df692b3-37db-44f8-98aa-46de96e6bed1.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/de7355b1-2f25-48b0-bf73-8763173c302c/width=525/de7355b1-2f25-48b0-bf73-8763173c302c.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/0ec179b8-c34b-47dd-b968-1c1dcdb77f6f/width=525/0ec179b8-c34b-47dd-b968-1c1dcdb77f6f.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/6229676e-78aa-45c1-ad79-80944b12ce02/width=525/6229676e-78aa-45c1-ad79-80944b12ce02.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/1a9914e1-4ca1-4a8a-a960-3b645e388e2d/width=525/1a9914e1-4ca1-4a8a-a960-3b645e388e2d.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/60f2bfc8-7746-48ff-92de-9ecc6a3b4265/width=525/60f2bfc8-7746-48ff-92de-9ecc6a3b4265.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/5f62662c-f4d1-495a-a95b-c6391e6537a0/width=525/5f62662c-f4d1-495a-a95b-c6391e6537a0.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/cbbddc47-a10e-4849-8a06-1c3821fda54b/width=525/cbbddc47-a10e-4849-8a06-1c3821fda54b.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/546607f1-0115-4eed-bb3a-36840912ec3a/width=525/546607f1-0115-4eed-bb3a-36840912ec3a.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/0d1fb623-5fdb-4d0d-ba9e-795761bd4ec4/width=525/0d1fb623-5fdb-4d0d-ba9e-795761bd4ec4.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/15c4d472-91b7-40e0-8298-b84aa1da1ddc/width=525/15c4d472-91b7-40e0-8298-b84aa1da1ddc.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/e76ebca8-3045-43b0-8b73-e9679ae7d5ed/width=525/e76ebca8-3045-43b0-8b73-e9679ae7d5ed.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>对于低 VRAM，强烈建议使用 2.1 型号。在相同分辨率下使用1.5没有任何优势。上图是1.5的，下图是2.1的</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/6ef9a011-1378-458c-8dbc-fa9ea2a335c1/width=525/6ef9a011-1378-458c-8dbc-fa9ea2a335c1.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/5a3f2e15-294f-4a3f-a7bc-620a01d6532f/width=525/5a3f2e15-294f-4a3f-a7bc-620a01d6532f.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>有些图片有水印，因为我连提示都没有写，只是用WD14生成的，所以没有负面提示</p><p>这个工作流程允许 1660 显卡在一分钟内只需要 20 个步骤就可以生成像样的 1152*768 图像。我知道这一点是因为我使用的是 1660 显卡。我在sdnext中生成相同质量的图像至少需要3倍的时间（几乎相同的生成时间，但需要面部修复，Hrfix等操作才能达到Comfy的图像质量）。它也不像我的工作流程那么可控</p><p>我相信下面提到的以下内容是使用此工作流程的必要设置。如果您直接使用我的工作流程，则需要将“pipeloader”节点的“neg_weight”设置为“down_weight”，并且我建议使用高剪辑强度来获取细节Lora，不要使用dpmpp-3m采样器，当您的VRAM较低时它会打破眼睛。我在工作流程文件中提供了一个采样器网格，可以使用低 vram 更好地生成图像</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/ad2f2b45-81dd-45b7-bfda-21ab9a006776/width=525/ad2f2b45-81dd-45b7-bfda-21ab9a006776.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>需要展开这个图片输出节点并修改保存图片的路径</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/45a21297-9310-418d-b639-60512fd8effc/width=525/45a21297-9310-418d-b639-60512fd8effc.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>该开关控制所有提示词和一些附加功能的生成。我不能使用通配符 __<strong>xxx*</strong>_ 特征</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/50c455fd-09d7-4480-ab54-00418702558e/width=525/50c455fd-09d7-4480-ab54-00418702558e.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>该噪声节点为图像提供颜色。当 v_max 值高于 140 时，会导致绿色过度饱和。此外，您还可以在此处控制图像的颜色。例如，如果想要更红的图像，可以增加 red_min 参数</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/739cce69-a7e9-4be5-9dfa-2225d0df5bb7/width=525/739cce69-a7e9-4be5-9dfa-2225d0df5bb7.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>该噪声节点提供黑色和白色，调制器将在衣服上创建皱纹细节。将密度保持在最高水平，您可以根据自己的喜好调整调制器。您需要翻转宽度和高度输入。该节点的输入取反</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/4e8ac829-a579-4880-adb3-3c380e9563c3/width=525/4e8ac829-a579-4880-adb3-3c380e9563c3.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/466a16f0-3f73-4942-8d41-d3bb180c257c/width=525/466a16f0-3f73-4942-8d41-d3bb180c257c.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/097bb24f-982e-4865-9536-2b20e727306d/width=525/097bb24f-982e-4865-9536-2b20e727306d.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>该节点为两个噪声节点提供混合模式，从而产生不同的图像。通过手动输入混合中的最后一位数字X -0.00X，可以调整图像细节。可以修复损坏的img一段时间，点击箭头通常会生成新图像</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/40bf7d21-65d7-45fa-8591-93f05c58f961/width=525/40bf7d21-65d7-45fa-8591-93f05c58f961.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/63564092-f6b2-4e48-8cb4-4b0e8fb5f12b/width=525/63564092-f6b2-4e48-8cb4-4b0e8fb5f12b.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>该开关，1为原始潜伏变焦，有4种变焦模式，可以提供漂亮的散景效果。2为像素升级，3为组织潜伏无潜伏4</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/208b7e2c-4c5f-43f3-8ccc-b72fa3b59a5f/width=525/208b7e2c-4c5f-43f3-8ccc-b72fa3b59a5f.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/e879944e-d78f-41d7-9e4e-e27475661969/width=525/e879944e-d78f-41d7-9e4e-e27475661969.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>41 用于 pro 42 用于 neg 嵌入</p><p>49 代表专业 65 代表否定</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/b9e14ced-6590-4843-8ce6-85a03fe8fb86/width=525/b9e14ced-6590-4843-8ce6-85a03fe8fb86.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>节点</p><p>它需要很多节点，所以我建议下载核心并自己构建</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/user/xww911/models\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://civitai.com/user/xww911/models</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/ltdrdata/ComfyUI-Impact-Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/ltdrdata/ComfyUI-Impact-Pack</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI_experiments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI_experiments</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/WASasquatch/was-node-suite-comfyui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/WASasquatch/was-node-suite-comfyui</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/city96/SD-Latent-Upscaler\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/city96/SD-Latent-Upscaler</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/pythongosssss/ComfyUI-WD14-Tagger\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/pythongosssss/ComfyUI-WD14-Tagger</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/tinyterra/ComfyUI_tinyterraNodes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/tinyterra/ComfyUI_tinyterraNodes</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jordach/comfy-plasma\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/Jordach/comfy-plasma</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/ssitu/ComfyUI_NestedNodeBuilder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/ssitu/ComfyUI_NestedNodeBuilder</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/pythongosssss/ComfyUI-Custom-Scripts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/pythongosssss/ComfyUI-Custom-Scripts</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/adieyal/comfyui-dynamicprompts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/adieyal/comfyui-dynamicprompts</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/wsippel/comfyui_ws\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/wsippel/comfyui_ws</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy</a></p><p>终于写完了</p><p>old⬇</p><p>--旧工作流程生成“运行时错误：调用 Python 对象时超出最大递归深度”错误，因此我拆分了工作流程。</p><p>旧版报错，不确定哪个节点，所以我拆开了翻译和潜空间控制。</p><p>翻译部分用到的节点---<a href=\"https://civitai.com/user/xww911/models\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://civitai.com/user/xww911/models</a></p><h2>这个工作流程可以做什么（所有图像都是通过使用种子1调整潜在空间参数生成的）：</h2><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/683da0f0-d211-471d-af41-6afc63d72d34/width=525/683da0f0-d211-471d-af41-6afc63d72d34.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/e46e0b08-7dcf-46fa-8a77-7c2781686fcf/width=525/e46e0b08-7dcf-46fa-8a77-7c2781686fcf.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>1、更深层次的HDR效果。</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/03cf610a-c29d-431a-9582-07d8e665b2b8/width=525/03cf610a-c29d-431a-9582-07d8e665b2b8.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/794fff64-3928-45d1-93e8-1a2ab04dc57c/width=525/794fff64-3928-45d1-93e8-1a2ab04dc57c.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>2、调整参数可以实现细节的修改</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/8b28ec8e-493a-4d20-a9c8-0cfcb3cd6e95/width=525/8b28ec8e-493a-4d20-a9c8-0cfcb3cd6e95.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/2015e5f7-f260-41e2-974e-b1b4789baa06/width=525/2015e5f7-f260-41e2-974e-b1b4789baa06.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/3054e2d0-372a-4588-89bb-33197ba7cb7a/width=525/3054e2d0-372a-4588-89bb-33197ba7cb7a.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/a20d79fe-1c7e-467a-9374-5e7546794fa4/width=525/a20d79fe-1c7e-467a-9374-5e7546794fa4.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>3、我的结论主要是WD1.4推理的结果，可以达到与原始图像相似的结果。很容易恢复所需的图像。</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/2fdc7d3c-b99c-4711-8a76-d461964eac51/width=525/2fdc7d3c-b99c-4711-8a76-d461964eac51.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/39be7dbd-5fd9-4ffc-82a3-4d6efe291353/width=525/39be7dbd-5fd9-4ffc-82a3-4d6efe291353.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>4、改变颜色，改变细节</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/2e6902e5-7017-4b45-83fc-c15265583c5e/width=525/2e6902e5-7017-4b45-83fc-c15265583c5e.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>5,More beautiful flares, blur, cleaner colors, and the ability to appear alongside black(This effect only occurs when using the original version of latent upscale)</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/bfcaa580-edfa-433f-abb0-d22177776a5f/width=525/bfcaa580-edfa-433f-abb0-d22177776a5f.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>6,we can fix bug now</p><p>I am trying to use this method on the 2.1 model, which allows me to generate larger images. However, my 1660S graphics card cannot test the XL model, so I hope someone can provide feedback</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/82098\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://civitai.com/models/82098</a>--high clip strength 6-7</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/20793/was-node-suite-comfyui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://civitai.com/models/20793/was-node-suite-comfyui</a></p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/87609/comfyroll-custom-nodes-for-comfyui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://civitai.com/models/87609/comfyroll-custom-nodes-for-comfyui</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jordach/comfy-plasma\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/Jordach/comfy-plasma</a></p><p>old⬇</p><p>-工作流支持直接中文输入提示词自动翻译英语，两种图反推词，wildcard,自动补全和随机下mj图库的提示词，还有一个摄影的大包和风格的大包，都是别人的节点，让我合一个工作流了，提示词现在跟A4一样方便。</p><p>I discovered that noisy latent space can affect the generated images. So, with this workflow, I combined a colored noise latent space with Voronoi Diagram into one image, and then input it into the sampler to generate good images with stronger controllability. All of my samples were generated using the seed \"1\". This makes me love comfyui even more.</p><p>The images generated by this workflow on the sd2.1 model are not as good as those with 1.5. It might be an issue with the clip weights, but I'm not good at that. Since I have a 1660S graphics card, I cannot test the sdxl model. So, if you're interested, you can download my workflow and give it a try, or download the corresponding nodes to set it up yourself.The main working nodes require these three packages.</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/20793/was-node-suite-comfyui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://civitai.com/models/20793/was-node-suite-comfyui</a></p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/87609/comfyroll-custom-nodes-for-comfyui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://civitai.com/models/87609/comfyroll-custom-nodes-for-comfyui</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jordach/comfy-plasma\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/Jordach/comfy-plasma</a></p><p>I think we need an automatic mute function for unconnected nodes.</p>","lang":"en","v":2,"o":{"en":"<p>This is the sharpest setting at 768*768 when using CUDA. I hope you guys also share your findings. I can't do extensive testing myself. F**k all those big bitc digger. I bought a 1660s when graphics cards were at their most expensive</p><p>and If anyone is interested, this is how I use it</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/WASasquatch/PPF_Noise_ComfyUI/wiki/Walkthrough\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/WASasquatch/PPF_Noise_ComfyUI/wiki/Walkthrough</a></p><p>My English is not very good, but this issue can explain how the workflow works.</p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/WASasquatch/was-node-suite-comfyui/issues/175\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/WASasquatch/was-node-suite-comfyui/issues/175</a></p><p>I believe this can bring some free quality improvements with almost no cost. Whether it gets better or not, you need to judge based on the images I generate. It takes me 120 seconds to generate a large image of 1024 pixels, so I need more people to experiment and find out which noise works best for the details in the image. That's why I keep releasing things</p><p>Thanks to @WAS</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/user/WAS/models\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://civitai.com/user/WAS/models</a></p><p>'WASasquatch on GitHub' for their contribution</p><p>old⬇</p><p>I heavily used my workflow for about a week and discovered many settings that affect the image. Previously, I was too lazy to write detailed instructions for the workflow. With the implementation of the mute switch, I have merged the two cores again, I will explain in detail how it works</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/c7426da7-a0da-46b1-a1fe-c7292210a306/width=525/c7426da7-a0da-46b1-a1fe-c7292210a306.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/1ca10976-d45f-4765-be5f-a650dce9c0f2/width=525/1ca10976-d45f-4765-be5f-a650dce9c0f2.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>It requires many nodes, so I recommend downloading the core and building it yourself</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/15445b46-6556-40d7-9556-81d4766bb6dd/width=525/15445b46-6556-40d7-9556-81d4766bb6dd.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/47aa14b5-cdc4-47c4-949e-211897e03740/width=525/47aa14b5-cdc4-47c4-949e-211897e03740.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/5df692b3-37db-44f8-98aa-46de96e6bed1/width=525/5df692b3-37db-44f8-98aa-46de96e6bed1.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/de7355b1-2f25-48b0-bf73-8763173c302c/width=525/de7355b1-2f25-48b0-bf73-8763173c302c.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/0ec179b8-c34b-47dd-b968-1c1dcdb77f6f/width=525/0ec179b8-c34b-47dd-b968-1c1dcdb77f6f.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/6229676e-78aa-45c1-ad79-80944b12ce02/width=525/6229676e-78aa-45c1-ad79-80944b12ce02.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/1a9914e1-4ca1-4a8a-a960-3b645e388e2d/width=525/1a9914e1-4ca1-4a8a-a960-3b645e388e2d.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/60f2bfc8-7746-48ff-92de-9ecc6a3b4265/width=525/60f2bfc8-7746-48ff-92de-9ecc6a3b4265.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/5f62662c-f4d1-495a-a95b-c6391e6537a0/width=525/5f62662c-f4d1-495a-a95b-c6391e6537a0.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/cbbddc47-a10e-4849-8a06-1c3821fda54b/width=525/cbbddc47-a10e-4849-8a06-1c3821fda54b.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/546607f1-0115-4eed-bb3a-36840912ec3a/width=525/546607f1-0115-4eed-bb3a-36840912ec3a.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/0d1fb623-5fdb-4d0d-ba9e-795761bd4ec4/width=525/0d1fb623-5fdb-4d0d-ba9e-795761bd4ec4.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/15c4d472-91b7-40e0-8298-b84aa1da1ddc/width=525/15c4d472-91b7-40e0-8298-b84aa1da1ddc.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/e76ebca8-3045-43b0-8b73-e9679ae7d5ed/width=525/e76ebca8-3045-43b0-8b73-e9679ae7d5ed.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>Strongly recommend using the 2.1 model for low VRAM. There is no advantage to using 1.5 at the same resolution. The image above is from 1.5, and the one below is from 2.1</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/6ef9a011-1378-458c-8dbc-fa9ea2a335c1/width=525/6ef9a011-1378-458c-8dbc-fa9ea2a335c1.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/5a3f2e15-294f-4a3f-a7bc-620a01d6532f/width=525/5a3f2e15-294f-4a3f-a7bc-620a01d6532f.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>Some images have watermarks because I didn't even write prompts, and just generated them using WD14, so there are no negative prompts</p><p>This workflow allows a 1660 graphics card to generate a decent 1152*768 image with only 20 steps in one minute. I know this because I am using a 1660 graphics card. It takes at least 3 times longer for me to generate the same quality image in sdnext(Almost the same generation time, but facial repair, Hrfix and other operations are needed to achieve the image quality of Comfy).It is also not as controllable as my workflow</p><p>I believe the following things mentioned below are necessary settings for using this workflow. If you directly use my workflow, you need to set the 'neg_weight' of the 'pipeloader' node to 'down_weight,And I recommend using high clip strength for details Lora,Do not use the dpmpp-3m sampler, it broke eyes whan you have low VRAM. I have provided a sampler grid in the workflow file that can generate images better with low vram</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/ad2f2b45-81dd-45b7-bfda-21ab9a006776/width=525/ad2f2b45-81dd-45b7-bfda-21ab9a006776.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>You need to expand this image output node and modify the path to save the image</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/45a21297-9310-418d-b639-60512fd8effc/width=525/45a21297-9310-418d-b639-60512fd8effc.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>This switch controls the generation of all prompt words and some additional functionalities. I cannot use the wildcard __<strong>xxx*</strong>_ feature</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/50c455fd-09d7-4480-ab54-00418702558e/width=525/50c455fd-09d7-4480-ab54-00418702558e.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>this noise node provides color to the image. When the v_max value is higher than 140, it results in an overly saturated green color. Additionally, this is where you can control the image's color. For example, if you want a redder image, you can increase the red_min parameter</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/739cce69-a7e9-4be5-9dfa-2225d0df5bb7/width=525/739cce69-a7e9-4be5-9dfa-2225d0df5bb7.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>This noise node provides black and white,The modulator will create wrinkle details on the clothes . Keep the density at the highest level, and you can adjust the modulator according to your preference.You need to flip the width and height inputs. The input of this node is reversed</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/4e8ac829-a579-4880-adb3-3c380e9563c3/width=525/4e8ac829-a579-4880-adb3-3c380e9563c3.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/466a16f0-3f73-4942-8d41-d3bb180c257c/width=525/466a16f0-3f73-4942-8d41-d3bb180c257c.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/097bb24f-982e-4865-9536-2b20e727306d/width=525/097bb24f-982e-4865-9536-2b20e727306d.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>This node provides a blend mode for the two noise nodes, resulting in different images. By manually inputting the last digit X in the blend -0.00X, you can adjust the image details.can fix broken img some time ,Clicking the arrow generally generates a new image</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/40bf7d21-65d7-45fa-8591-93f05c58f961/width=525/40bf7d21-65d7-45fa-8591-93f05c58f961.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/63564092-f6b2-4e48-8cb4-4b0e8fb5f12b/width=525/63564092-f6b2-4e48-8cb4-4b0e8fb5f12b.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>This switch, 1 is for original latent zoom, with 4 zooming modes that can provide a beautiful bokeh effect.2 is pixel upscal,3 is org latant no latent4</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/208b7e2c-4c5f-43f3-8ccc-b72fa3b59a5f/width=525/208b7e2c-4c5f-43f3-8ccc-b72fa3b59a5f.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/e879944e-d78f-41d7-9e4e-e27475661969/width=525/e879944e-d78f-41d7-9e4e-e27475661969.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>41 for pro 42 for neg embedding</p><p>49 for pro 65 for neg</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/b9e14ced-6590-4843-8ce6-85a03fe8fb86/width=525/b9e14ced-6590-4843-8ce6-85a03fe8fb86.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>nodes</p><p>It requires many nodes, so I recommend downloading the core and building it yourself</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/user/xww911/models\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://civitai.com/user/xww911/models</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/ltdrdata/ComfyUI-Impact-Pack\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/ltdrdata/ComfyUI-Impact-Pack</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI_experiments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/comfyanonymous/ComfyUI_experiments</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/WASasquatch/was-node-suite-comfyui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/WASasquatch/was-node-suite-comfyui</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/city96/SD-Latent-Upscaler\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/city96/SD-Latent-Upscaler</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/pythongosssss/ComfyUI-WD14-Tagger\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/pythongosssss/ComfyUI-WD14-Tagger</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/tinyterra/ComfyUI_tinyterraNodes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/tinyterra/ComfyUI_tinyterraNodes</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jordach/comfy-plasma\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/Jordach/comfy-plasma</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/ssitu/ComfyUI_NestedNodeBuilder\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/ssitu/ComfyUI_NestedNodeBuilder</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/pythongosssss/ComfyUI-Custom-Scripts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/pythongosssss/ComfyUI-Custom-Scripts</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/adieyal/comfyui-dynamicprompts\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/adieyal/comfyui-dynamicprompts</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/wsippel/comfyui_ws\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/wsippel/comfyui_ws</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/rgthree/rgthree-comfy</a></p><p>--The old workflow generated a 'RuntimeError: maximum recursion depth exceeded while calling a Python object' error, so I split the workflow.</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/user/xww911/models\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"></a></p><h2>what this work flow can do(All images are generated by adjusting latent space parameters using Seed 1#):</h2><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/683da0f0-d211-471d-af41-6afc63d72d34/width=525/683da0f0-d211-471d-af41-6afc63d72d34.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/e46e0b08-7dcf-46fa-8a77-7c2781686fcf/width=525/e46e0b08-7dcf-46fa-8a77-7c2781686fcf.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>1,Deeper-level HDR effect.</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/03cf610a-c29d-431a-9582-07d8e665b2b8/width=525/03cf610a-c29d-431a-9582-07d8e665b2b8.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/794fff64-3928-45d1-93e8-1a2ab04dc57c/width=525/794fff64-3928-45d1-93e8-1a2ab04dc57c.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>2,Adjusting parameters can achieve modifications in details</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/8b28ec8e-493a-4d20-a9c8-0cfcb3cd6e95/width=525/8b28ec8e-493a-4d20-a9c8-0cfcb3cd6e95.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/2015e5f7-f260-41e2-974e-b1b4789baa06/width=525/2015e5f7-f260-41e2-974e-b1b4789baa06.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/3054e2d0-372a-4588-89bb-33197ba7cb7a/width=525/3054e2d0-372a-4588-89bb-33197ba7cb7a.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/a20d79fe-1c7e-467a-9374-5e7546794fa4/width=525/a20d79fe-1c7e-467a-9374-5e7546794fa4.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>3,My proitive are mostly the results of WD1.4 inference, which can achieve results similar to the original image. It is easy to restore the desired image.</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/2fdc7d3c-b99c-4711-8a76-d461964eac51/width=525/2fdc7d3c-b99c-4711-8a76-d461964eac51.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/39be7dbd-5fd9-4ffc-82a3-4d6efe291353/width=525/39be7dbd-5fd9-4ffc-82a3-4d6efe291353.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>4,Change the color, change the details</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/2e6902e5-7017-4b45-83fc-c15265583c5e/width=525/2e6902e5-7017-4b45-83fc-c15265583c5e.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>5,More beautiful flares, blur, cleaner colors, and the ability to appear alongside black(This effect only occurs when using the original version of latent upscale)</p><p><img src=\"https://image.civitai.com/xG1nkqKTMzGDvpLrqFT7WA/bfcaa580-edfa-433f-abb0-d22177776a5f/width=525/bfcaa580-edfa-433f-abb0-d22177776a5f.jpeg\" loading=\"lazy\"></p><p>6,we can fix bug now</p><p>I am trying to use this method on the 2.1 model, which allows me to generate larger images. However, my 1660S graphics card cannot test the XL model, so I hope someone can provide feedback</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/82098\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://civitai.com/models/82098</a>--high clip strength 6-7</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/20793/was-node-suite-comfyui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://civitai.com/models/20793/was-node-suite-comfyui</a></p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/87609/comfyroll-custom-nodes-for-comfyui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://civitai.com/models/87609/comfyroll-custom-nodes-for-comfyui</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jordach/comfy-plasma\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/Jordach/comfy-plasma</a></p><p>old⬇</p><p>I discovered that noisy latent space can affect the generated images. So, with this workflow, I combined a colored noise latent space with Voronoi Diagram into one image, and then input it into the sampler to generate good images with stronger controllability. All of my samples were generated using the seed \"1\". This makes me love comfyui even more.</p><p>The images generated by this workflow on the sd2.1 model are not as good as those with 1.5. It might be an issue with the clip weights, but I'm not good at that. Since I have a 1660S graphics card, I cannot test the sdxl model. So, if you're interested, you can download my workflow and give it a try, or download the corresponding nodes to set it up yourself.The main working nodes require these three packages.</p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/20793/was-node-suite-comfyui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://civitai.com/models/20793/was-node-suite-comfyui</a></p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/models/87609/comfyroll-custom-nodes-for-comfyui\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://civitai.com/models/87609/comfyroll-custom-nodes-for-comfyui</a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/Jordach/comfy-plasma\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\">https://github.com/Jordach/comfy-plasma</a></p><p>I think we need an automatic mute function for unconnected nodes.</p>","zh":"<p><a href=\"https://github.com/WASasquatch/PPF_Noise_ComfyUI/wiki/Walkthrough\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://github.com/WASasquatch/was-node-suite-comfyui/issues/175\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"></a></p><p><a href=\"https://civitai.com/user/WAS/models\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener ugc nofollow\"></a></p><p><img